{
  "title": "Quick Roasted Peruvian Tomato Anticuchos",
  "description": "A light and quick Peruvian dish featuring roasted tinned tomatoes, served in a paella pan and formed into anticuchos, perfect for a vegan meal.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
